    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII-based timed I/O operations (read/write) with timeout support. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.0.1 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Phase 2.1.1 Timeout &amp; I/O Safety</para>
</simplesect>
Provides safe, bounded I/O operations for POSIX file descriptors with explicit timeout handling. Prevents indefinite blocking on pipes and sockets. </para>
